      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I used to hate this idea, but trying to parse the Network IK handwriting for mute users sadly does make this necessary. Most mute users are just not in a place they can speak, for example, having people sleeping within earshot. However there is an argument to be made for actual disabled users needing this as well. Sadly haven't seen much of the few deaf people since the Network IK update ruined their ability to communicate with each other.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
